  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:13px;\"><div style=\"white-space:pre;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\">We're looking to partner with creators who genuinely wear prescription glasses and would appreciate a pair that feels good enough for daily use, not just another tech product to try once. </span></span></div><div style=\"white-space:pre;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\">Dymesty AI glasses are designed with that balance in mind: a refined, comfortable frame with smart features built in.</span></span></div><div style=\"white-space:pre;\"><br></div><div style=\"white-space:pre;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\">We're inviting a select group of creators to join our affiliate program and create content around their experience with Dymesty. For creators we collaborate with, we provide a complimentary pair of our AI glasses(+lenses), valued at $400+, so you can genuinely experience the product and share it with your audience.</span></span></div><div style=\"white-space:pre;\"><br></div><div style=\"white-space:pre;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\">Through your affiliate link, you would earn 10% commission on every sale you drive. Most customers don't just buy the frames. They order complete prescription glasses, often with progressive or photochromic lenses, so the average order value is $400+. That means you could earn $40+ from every referred sale.</span></span></div><div style=\"white-space:pre;\"><br></div><div style=\"white-space:pre;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\">Dymesty has also been featured in Android Authority, and we'd be excited to have you share the product in your own voice.</span></span></div><div style=\"white-space:pre;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\">Would you be interested in joining the program and exploring a content collaboration?</span></span></div></div></div></div>",
